low hiding-place perspective between dry corn stalks. The camera uses an extreme wide-angle fisheye look, bending the horizon and sky toward the edges while blurred nearest stalks sweep across the foreground like a partial obstruction. In the midground, four weathered scarecrows stand crookedly on rough wooden cross-shaped frames, their straw-yellow bodies and faded burlap-brown clothing forming a loose arc across the field. Slightly off center among them, a young woman in a deep dark red long dress hangs from ropes beneath a horizontal beam; her head is lowered, and long hair covers her face completely. The dress remains heavy and motionless, with one small saturated area of dried crimson against the otherwise drained palette. The closest corn stalks are dry ochre yellow, with brittle leaves and bent stems, rendered as soft, smeared foreground shapes. Farther back, more stalks recede into gray-white fog that swallows the fields and flattens the distant horizon. The soil is dark brown and freshly worked-looking, uneven and muddy under the scarecrow frames. The sky is lead gray, overcast, and dim, with no hard shadows; only a broken remnant of twilight catches the red dress, the ropes, and the straw edges. The visual language stays grounded in live-action horror: chemical color density, thick textured shadows, slight lens softness at the edges, fine organic grain heavier in darkness, and a bleak folk-horror atmosphere rather than stylized animation. There are no other people visible beyond the suspended woman, and the composition emphasizes concealment, decay, silence, and the feeling of being watched or spying."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 710, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [498.5720520019531, 431.05999755859375], "pos": [442.2817687988281, 3587.933349609375], "id": 484, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "d9c2072a2de5f51ef9898ec50ccd4dda82e16126", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#335", "groupcolor": "#88A", "color": "#223"}}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "文本", "links": [717], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["一张独立的真人电影静帧，来自一部末世荒凉基调的乡村民俗恐怖片。荒废的农田，死寂黄昏：成排枯萎的玉米秆，四个穿着褪色麻布外套的破旧稻草人歪斜地架在木十字架上，稻草人中间，一个穿深红长裙的年轻女子被绳索悬吊在一根木横梁下，头颅低垂，长发遮住整张脸，沉重的裙料完全静止。这是一次藏匿者的窥视视点：摄影机蹲伏在干枯作物丛深处，从秆与秆的缝隙间偷看；极广角鱼眼镜头，地平线向边缘外弯，天空变形，最近的枯秆弯曲着、虚化地抹过画面边缘，像挡在猫眼上的手指。前景虚焦枯秆，中景是呈弧线排列的稻草人群，悬吊的红裙人物略偏中心，背景是田野消融进去的灰白雾霭。色名列表：干枯赭黄的玉米秆、稻草黄的填充物、褪色麻布褐、风化灰木、铅灰天空、深褐翻耕土、灰白雾——以及裙上一小块深干红，全画唯一饱和之物。平淡将尽的阴天光，无硬影，仅有一道破碎的暮色残光落在红裙与绳上；稻草边缘微亮，麻布哑光下沉。基底：2000年代初35mm恐怖片拷贝：强光化学色彩密度、厚重暗部保有纹理、红布上轻微光晕溢出、边缘可见镜头柔度、远处田野被大气雾吞没、细而不均的有机颗粒在暗部更重。不要卡通动漫感，不要文字水印，画面中不要出现其他人。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-181.94703674316406, 1094.0230712890625], "id": 491, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 4}, {"showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [688], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [689], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["16:9 (Widescreen)", 2.2, 8], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "preview", "label": "preview", "type": "RESOLUTION_PREVIEW", "localized_name": "preview"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "megapixels"}, "name": "megapixels", "label": "megapixels", "type": "FLOAT", 